130
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:23,680
So the name actually means reason plus act.

131
00:14:24,302 --> 00:14:30,276
So instead of thinking once and then answering the question, what the model does here is actually a loop.

132
00:14:30,574 --> 00:14:38,480
It thinks about what to do next, take action, and then look at what happened, and then use that to think again.

133
00:14:38,734 --> 00:14:41,028
So it's actually a loop happening here.

134
00:14:42,286 --> 00:14:47,520
