00:49:06,894 --> 00:49:13,828
And then they basically generate the synthetic data from that and then trend a 7 billion parameter model on top of that.

451
00:49:15,022 --> 00:49:26,224
at the inference time, if we look at this example, if the user says that I want to see some cats dancing in celebration, then you are going to do a retrieval here.

